  "question": {
    "text": "The locus of the centre of a circle which cuts the circle <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> orthogonally and also touches the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>",
